  "details": "- Update to jdk-21.0.11+10 (GA)\n- Resolves Oracle April 2026 CPU CVEs:\n  CVE-2026-22007, CVE-2026-22013, CVE-2026-22016, CVE-2026-22018, CVE-2026-22021,\n  CVE-2026-34268, CVE-2026-34282\n- CVE-2026-23865: integer overflow in tt_var_load_item_variation_store in\n  bundled FreeType (fixed via bump to 2.14.2)\n- Update FIPS patch to feef2dc3ca7\n- Bump bundled freetype 2.13.3 -> 2.14.2, giflib 5.2.2 -> 6.1.2,\n  harfbuzz 11.2.0 -> 12.3.2, libpng 1.6.51 -> 1.6.57, zlib 1.3.1 -> 1.3.2\n- Add JDK-8375294 EOPNOTSUPP patch (carried by AlmaLinux 9 ahead of 21.0.13)",
